      "text": "This very forgetful Pokémon will wait for a new order from its Trainer even though it already has one.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "These Pokémon live in cities. They are accustomed to people. Flocks often gather in parks and plazas.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "Where people go, these Pokémon follow. If you’re scattering food for them, be careful— several hundred of them can gather at once.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "It’s forgetful and not very bright, but many Trainers love it anyway for its friendliness and sincerity.",
      "version": "shield"
    }
